Revoke an acs flag from an account.

usage: @revoke <account> <flag>

Clears a single access-control flag on an account. The change is stored
on the account and lasts across logins. A flag is one letter or digit.
The 'w' flag marks an account as wizard-capable.

Wizard only. Use @grant to set a flag.

Example:
  @revoke alice w   Remove wizard capability from the account 'alice'.
